│ levels (r= 0.72 and 0.56, respectively), but not with plasma levels of imipramine alone.europepmc.org"},             │
│ {"study_index": 24, "title": "Randomized, controlled trial of amitriptyline versus placebo for adolescents with      │
│ "treatment‐resistant" major depression", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To assess the response to a                          │
│ serotonergic/noradrenergic tricyclic antidepressant, amitriptyline (AMI), in a group of adolescents with             │
│ treatment-resistant major depressive disorder (MDD). METHOD Twenty-seven depressed adolescents admitted to a state   │
